    "body":  "This PR deliberately changes one test expectation (`formatVnd(45000)` expects `0đ`) so that the normal CI pipeline detects a real assertion failure. It supplies the failed-run evidence requested by Assignment 2 §6.4 / NFR-17.\n\nOnly `apps/web/src/lib/format.test.ts` differs from the Task 4 branch. The workflow and application behavior are unchanged. Install and Lint should pass, Unit Test should fail with expected `0đ` versus received `45.000đ`, and Build should be skipped.\n\nDO NOT MERGE. This evidence-only PR will be closed after downloading the GitHub Actions logs. Draft Task 4 PR: #9. No claim is made that branch protection is enabled: the current private repository reports that its plan must be upgraded or its visibility changed to support that feature, and the current contributor has no admin permission.\n",
